@startuml
state Inactive [*]
state Registered
state LoggedIn
state WatchingVideo
state UploadingVideo
state LikedVideo
state ViewLikesList
state InDiscussion
state Terminated

Inactive -- AccountCreationEvent > Registered
Registered -- LoginEvent > LoggedIn
LoggedIn -- WatchVideoEvent > WatchingVideo
WatchingVideo -- SaveLikeEvent > LikedVideo
WatchingVideo -- ViewLikesListEvent > ViewLikesList
LoggedIn -- EnterDiscussionEvent > InDiscussion
(Terminated: multiple final states depending on termination reasons)

@enduml
